{
  "slug": "holistics-reporting",
  "name": "Holistics Reporting",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Skills for exploring and analyzing data in Holistics using published analytics.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **7 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (7): `analyze-data` (Explain AQL queries and their results, and provide data insights), `search-docs` (Search Holistics documentation to answer questions about features, syntax, or concepts), `setup-holistics-mcp` (Use this skill to set up Holistics MCP and enable useful tools such as `search_docs`, `execute_aql`, and `generate_viz`), `use-existing-viz` (Search and use visualizations that already exist in the project to provide fast and curated data answers), `visualize-data` (Create charts, tables, and visualizations from queries), `working-in-reporting` (Use Holistics analytics skills and tooling to work with Holistics analytics more efficiently and effectively), `write-aql` (Write and run AQL (Analytic Query Language) queries to answer data questions)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install holistics-reporting@claude-community` from `holistics/skills` (`plugins/holistics-reporting`).",
